	// and each "core" provides 2 "cpu"s, the mapping would be:
	// {ResourceName: "cpu", capacityKey: "dra.example.com/cores", capacityMultiplier: "2"}.
	// If a claim consumes 8 "dra.example.com/cores", the CPU footprint is 8 * 2 = 16.
